Hi Team,

Please find below the Q3 2026 financial summary ahead of next Thursday's
board review session.

KEY HIGHLIGHTS
--------------
  * Revenue: $48.2M (+12% YoY) - driven by Enterprise segment growth
  * Gross Margin: 68.4% (up from 65.1% in Q2)
  * Net Income: $7.1M (+18% YoY)
  * Cash Position: $112M with $0 drawn on revolving credit facility
  * Customer Acquisition: 34 net-new enterprise logos

ACTION ITEMS
------------
  1. Review the attached slide deck and flag any data discrepancies
     to the Finance team (finance-review@acmecorp.com) by Wednesday COB.
  2. Prepare 2-3 talking points for your respective business unit
     sections - we'll do a dry run Friday at 10 AM ET.
  3. Emily (IR) will circulate the updated analyst consensus model
     separately.

The full deck is attached as a PDF. Note that Slides 14-18 covering
the APAC expansion pipeline are still marked DRAFT - Raj's team is
finalising the partner revenue projections.

Let me know if you have questions. Looking forward to a strong
board session.

